WEBVTT

00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:05.890
Nice job, Yayoi-chan!

00:00:05.890 --> 00:00:07.750
Looks great!

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:10.270
It's nothing special!

00:00:11.190 --> 00:00:13.750
What're you drawing, Yayoi-kuru?

00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:15.480
It's the cover for our field trip logbook.

00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:17.870
"Field trip"?  What's that-kuru?

00:00:18.270 --> 00:00:21.540
Our class is going on a trip for 3 days.

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:22.900
Going away...?

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:27.580
We all get to ride a bullet train, and gossip the whole way there!

00:00:27.990 --> 00:00:28.760
Kuru!

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:31.670
Our destination: the historic city of Kyoto!

00:00:31.670 --> 00:00:33.950
Then we head to my hometown, Osaka!

00:00:33.970 --> 00:00:36.350
The food there's somethin' else!

00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:37.720
Kuru!

00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:41.160
And at night, we get to talk about girly stuff together!

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:44.220
Kuru!

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:46.660
Hopefully we can bring back lots of souvenirs, too!

00:00:48.550 --> 00:00:50.240
Sounds like it's gonna be fun-kuru!

00:00:50.240 --> 00:00:52.060
Yeah, it is!

00:00:53.570 --> 00:00:56.840
May I remind you that this trip is supposed to broaden your horizons.

00:00:57.170 --> 00:01:00.900
In other words, don't neglect your studies.

00:01:00.900 --> 00:01:02.670
We know...

00:01:02.670 --> 00:01:05.160
Remember you're only allowed 500 yen worth of snacks, too.

00:01:06.350 --> 00:01:10.440
Snacks?! I can't wait-kuru!

00:01:10.440 --> 00:01:11.130
Candy!

00:01:11.310 --> 00:01:11.790
Kuru?

00:01:12.050 --> 00:01:13.750
Hold down the fort while we're gone, kay?

00:01:20.860 --> 00:01:22.430
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:01:22.430 --> 00:01:24.270
Smile Precure!

00:01:24.570 --> 00:01:25.170
Let's go!

00:01:25.170 --> 00:01:26.700
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:26.700 --> 00:01:27.840
All together!

00:01:28.070 --> 00:01:29.440
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:29.440 --> 00:01:31.640
Jump to tomorrow!

00:01:31.810 --> 00:01:34.310
Smile Precure!

00:01:36.180 --> 00:01:39.150
Smile! Smile! Smile Precure!

00:01:39.410 --> 00:01:44.590
A smile, shining like the sun.

00:01:44.950 --> 00:01:49.790
We all carry an undying sparkle.

00:01:50.520 --> 00:01:55.730
Keep going with all you've got, girls!

00:01:56.100 --> 00:02:00.670
Those beads of sweat are diamonds.

00:02:00.070 --> 00:02:00.630
So bright!

00:02:00.670 --> 00:02:05.840
The future that you'll shine the way to

00:02:06.210 --> 00:02:12.280
When you five lights seize the will to win.

00:02:10.240 --> 00:02:12.780
Happy! Sunny! Peace! March! Beauty!

00:02:13.310 --> 00:02:13.950
Let's go!

00:02:13.950 --> 00:02:16.650
(Smile! Smile!) The power of a smile

00:02:16.650 --> 00:02:19.590
(Smile! Smile!) Joins us all together.

00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:24.390
We'll never let a friend cry!

00:02:23.760 --> 00:02:24.960
Girls! Let's go!

00:02:25.030 --> 00:02:26.630
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:26.630 --> 00:02:27.760
Everybody!

00:02:27.800 --> 00:02:29.430
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:29.430 --> 00:02:31.970
Fly to the future!

00:02:32.300 --> 00:02:35.470
Sparkle! Smile Precure!

00:02:36.240 --> 00:02:37.640
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:02:37.640 --> 00:02:39.940
Smile Precure!

00:02:43.650 --> 00:02:46.760
I can't wait for the field trip...

00:02:50.420 --> 00:02:52.540
Have you been staying well, Candy?

00:02:52.820 --> 00:02:55.010
I'm not at the moment-kuru...

00:02:56.360 --> 00:02:58.300
Why? Did something happen-de gozaru?

00:02:58.300 --> 00:02:58.970
Kuru...

00:02:59.710 --> 00:03:02.260
Everyone's going on some fun field trip together...

00:03:02.260 --> 00:03:04.710
and they're leaving me behind-kuru!

00:03:05.180 --> 00:03:09.750
I wanna go on the field trip too! I wanna go, I wanna go!

00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:14.810
Candy! Have you forgotten your mission? Surely that should be of greater concern-de gozaru.

00:03:14.810 --> 00:03:19.480
Together, you and the Precure must gather the Cure Décor, and bring peace back to Märchenla-

00:03:22.590 --> 00:03:24.430
You make life difficult-de gozaru...

00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:36.820
I'll take this one-oni!

00:03:36.820 --> 00:03:38.180
I got the old maid-oni!

00:03:39.310 --> 00:03:42.150
Victory is mine!

00:03:42.590 --> 00:03:43.920
What?!

00:03:43.920 --> 00:03:46.470
Hello, my three dear commanders!

00:03:48.130 --> 00:03:50.570
How is life treating you this day?

00:03:50.570 --> 00:03:52.010
Hmph! It's just you, Joker.

00:03:52.010 --> 00:03:53.390
What do you want-da wasa?

00:03:53.400 --> 00:04:00.700
You've done a splendid job of collecting Bad Energy to bring back our glorious Emperor, King Pierrot-sama!

00:04:00.720 --> 00:04:01.890
Of course-oni!

00:04:01.890 --> 00:04:04.280
You came here just to flatter us-da wasa?

00:04:04.280 --> 00:04:05.340
Non, non!

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:08.550
The purpose of my visit, my dear, is to discuss the Precure!

00:04:09.450 --> 00:04:12.450
We didn't really expect them to be such a bother.

00:04:13.380 --> 00:04:15.390
I mean, they've caused you so many problems.

00:04:15.390 --> 00:04:16.990
What'd you say-da wasa?!

00:04:16.990 --> 00:04:18.430
Don't be ridiculous-oni!

00:04:18.430 --> 00:04:20.220
I'll obliterate them next time!

00:04:20.240 --> 00:04:23.410
Oh, that is remarkably reassuring!

00:04:23.410 --> 00:04:26.660
I suppose, then, you won't be needing these...

00:04:27.520 --> 00:04:29.270
What are those-da wasa?

00:04:29.270 --> 00:04:30.720
These are blue noses.

00:04:30.720 --> 00:04:31.940
Blue noses?

00:04:31.940 --> 00:04:32.640
Indeed.

00:04:33.130 --> 00:04:34.870
As opposed to our normal red noses,

00:04:34.870 --> 00:04:39.610
the Akanbe these generate will be totally immune to the Precures' moves.

00:04:39.610 --> 00:04:40.580
How?

00:04:41.010 --> 00:04:44.550
It's because these aren't made from Cure Décor like the usual ones.

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:49.420
Of course, that does mean they'll be weaker than your normal Akanbe...

00:04:49.710 --> 00:04:51.640
They're useless, then-oni!

00:04:51.640 --> 00:04:53.060
No...

00:04:53.320 --> 00:04:57.760
If they're immune to the Precures' attacks, we can use them to lay a trap-da wasa!

00:04:57.760 --> 00:04:59.130
Oh, I see!

00:04:59.470 --> 00:05:00.830
I get it-oni!

00:05:00.830 --> 00:05:03.290
I'm very glad to be of service!

00:05:03.290 --> 00:05:07.820
Alright then! Time for me to go crush those Precure!

00:05:07.820 --> 00:05:09.120
No!

00:05:09.120 --> 00:05:11.740
It's my turn to fight them-da wasa!

00:05:10.650 --> 00:05:11.740
No, mine-oni!

00:05:11.740 --> 00:05:13.140
I said I'd go first!

00:05:13.650 --> 00:05:17.110
Honestly, the things one puts up with...

00:05:17.410 --> 00:05:25.090
Now, perhaps I'd be better served searching for the Miracle Jewel, granter of a single wish...

00:05:28.800 --> 00:05:36.340
Now then, I'd like to take suggestions for where we'll go on our third, free day.

00:05:36.340 --> 00:05:37.420
I've got one!

00:05:37.420 --> 00:05:38.440
Yes, Inoue?

00:05:38.700 --> 00:05:42.400
If we're in Osaka, we should definitely go try the local takoyaki!

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:45.310
Sounds good! I can take ya all to a great little joint I know!

00:05:45.310 --> 00:05:47.810
Sounds like a plan, Hino!

00:05:47.810 --> 00:05:50.680
Don't say I didn't warn ya if you dislocate your hip from being so floored by 'em!

00:05:50.680 --> 00:05:53.380
I'd rather go shopping, actually...

00:05:53.760 --> 00:05:57.350
Why don't we visit the Tennouji Zoo? The animals there are so adorable!

00:05:57.540 --> 00:06:01.230
There's a Taiyouman show on that day in Namba, too...

00:06:01.590 --> 00:06:05.630
There's this bookstore in Osaka I've always wanted to go to that sells nothing but fairytale books!

00:06:06.560 --> 00:06:11.440
Hey, it's Osaka, we should go to Osaka Castle! The home of Shogun Toyotomi Hideyoshi!

00:06:11.440 --> 00:06:14.170
I want to see the Tsuutenkaku Tower!

00:06:14.170 --> 00:06:16.270
Let's go to the Expo '70 Commemorative Park!

00:06:16.520 --> 00:06:19.060
That's a bit far away...

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:19.790
Really?

00:06:19.790 --> 00:06:22.180
Like I said, we've gotta go see the Tsuutenkaku!

00:06:26.850 --> 00:06:29.320
Can we quiet down please?

00:06:31.190 --> 00:06:36.260
If you have a suggestion, please raise your hand and we'll consider them one at a time...

00:06:36.550 --> 00:06:38.730
Reika needs help-kuru!

00:06:39.220 --> 00:06:40.700
Can we have silence?

00:06:40.700 --> 00:06:44.190
Please, everyone?

00:06:46.930 --> 00:06:50.940
Will you listen to Reika for once-kuru?!

00:06:54.710 --> 00:06:57.380
Do excuse my little joke-kuru...

00:06:59.720 --> 00:07:02.980
Then we'll let each group decide where they want to go for themselves.

00:07:02.980 --> 00:07:05.370
I'd ask each group to appoint its own leader.

00:07:05.850 --> 00:07:07.960
Ya can be our leader, right, Reika?

00:07:07.960 --> 00:07:10.460
I think so too-kuru!

00:07:15.070 --> 00:07:16.860
Eh? What?

00:07:16.860 --> 00:07:21.590
Considering my position as class representative, perhaps someone else should take that role...

00:07:21.590 --> 00:07:23.390
Well then, how about Nao-chan?

00:07:23.390 --> 00:07:25.940
I think Nao'd be good-kuru!

00:07:30.710 --> 00:07:33.000
You'd be my pick, Miyuki-chan.

00:07:33.000 --> 00:07:34.660
You really think so?

00:07:34.660 --> 00:07:37.320
If no one else is going to, I'll do it-kuru!

00:07:40.850 --> 00:07:42.980
Candy, you've gotta stay hidden!

00:07:42.980 --> 00:07:48.630
<i>I... I wanna join in too-kuru!</i>

00:07:49.570 --> 00:07:53.120
Jeez, Candy! Stop scaring us like that!

00:07:53.120 --> 00:07:56.070
Hey, how about we go get our snacks for the trip!

00:07:56.070 --> 00:07:57.800
Sounds like fun! Let's-a go!

00:07:57.800 --> 00:08:00.600
We should make our logbooks first, however.

00:08:00.600 --> 00:08:02.550
Then let's go to the Wonder Library!

00:08:04.090 --> 00:08:05.510
There we go!

00:08:05.510 --> 00:08:06.920
We're nearly done now, I believe.

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:11.360
Now we just have to wait for the glue to dry, and then write our names in them.

00:08:11.650 --> 00:08:13.880
Well then, let's go get some snacks!

00:08:13.880 --> 00:08:15.230
Agreed!

00:08:15.490 --> 00:08:18.300
Let me help too!

00:08:20.230 --> 00:08:21.410
Oh, Candy!

00:08:21.410 --> 00:08:23.460
We've put in all that hard work...

00:08:23.460 --> 00:08:26.800
Well, what's done is done. We'll just start from scratch!

00:08:26.800 --> 00:08:29.940
It's... It's not my fault-kuru!

00:08:36.250 --> 00:08:37.460
Candy...

00:08:37.460 --> 00:08:38.010
Kuru...?

00:08:39.800 --> 00:08:41.250
Reika...

00:08:42.010 --> 00:08:43.520
What's the matter?

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:49.590
I wish they could rely on me like they rely on you, Reika...

00:08:49.590 --> 00:08:52.560
But I'm just a stupid, useless failure of a fairy-kuru!

00:08:52.560 --> 00:08:54.480
Oh, that's not true at all.

00:08:54.480 --> 00:08:58.740
After all, you came to my aid back in the classroom, didn't you?

00:08:59.040 --> 00:09:02.210
But you guys don't need me-kuru...

00:09:04.580 --> 00:09:07.940
I'm an awful fairy-kuru!

00:09:10.330 --> 00:09:11.880
Candy...

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:19.560
Hey there, fairy girl.

00:09:19.750 --> 00:09:20.320
Kuru!

00:09:20.320 --> 00:09:23.330
You know, this is just me talkin'...

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:27.030
But you don't really bring anything to the Precure's table, know what I mean?

00:09:27.180 --> 00:09:27.920
Kuru?

00:09:28.170 --> 00:09:31.800
They won't be around much longer. There's no tomorrow for them.

00:09:31.810 --> 00:09:36.010
That's not true-kuru! They'll never lose to you-kuru!

00:09:36.490 --> 00:09:40.470
Funny you say that... because I have this blue nose!

00:09:40.470 --> 00:09:42.440
W-What is that-kuru?!

00:09:42.440 --> 00:09:46.920
See, the Akanbe these spawn are totally immune to the Precure's moves!

00:09:47.820 --> 00:09:48.750
Oh, no-kuru!

00:09:50.420 --> 00:09:54.720
All I have to do is let them waste their energy firing off their attacks, and then-

00:09:54.720 --> 00:09:56.830
Damn it, she's run off!

00:09:56.970 --> 00:09:59.530
This is bad-kuru! I've gotta let them know-kuru!

00:09:59.530 --> 00:10:02.300
I can help them for once-kuru!

00:10:02.300 --> 00:10:04.000
I don't think so!

00:10:06.570 --> 00:10:09.380
You sit here and be good, now.

00:10:09.550 --> 00:10:11.040
Kuru!

00:10:11.740 --> 00:10:14.010
I've gotta help them-kuru!

00:10:18.450 --> 00:10:19.610
Beauty!

00:10:25.380 --> 00:10:26.670
Candy!

00:10:29.760 --> 00:10:32.290
There's so much to choose from...

00:10:32.310 --> 00:10:36.530
Which should we get? 500 yen each is never gonna be enough!

00:10:36.530 --> 00:10:39.830
Hey, what do you think, Candy?

00:10:39.840 --> 00:10:40.830
Huh?

00:10:41.750 --> 00:10:42.670
Candy?

00:10:43.810 --> 00:10:44.640
Miyuki-san...

00:10:45.680 --> 00:10:47.270
About Candy...

00:10:47.270 --> 00:10:49.240
I've got you now, Precure!

00:10:50.250 --> 00:10:51.340
Oh man, don't tell me!

00:10:55.160 --> 00:10:56.290
You!

00:10:56.290 --> 00:10:59.490
Yeah, it's me. Me with a new trick to show off!

00:11:00.780 --> 00:11:03.620
Come on out, Akanbe!

00:11:06.020 --> 00:11:08.360
Akanbe!

00:11:08.580 --> 00:11:10.800
A blue-nosed Akanbe?!

00:11:10.800 --> 00:11:13.000
The heck's with the shampoo hat around its waist?!

00:11:13.440 --> 00:11:17.280
This world will be stained with the worst possible conclusion...

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:19.670
...a Bad End!

00:11:19.670 --> 00:11:23.680
The blank slate of your future will be clouded in darkness!

00:11:29.860 --> 00:11:37.690
The Bad Energy we gather from the humans will resurrect the Emperor of Darkness, King Pierrot-sama!

00:11:41.420 --> 00:11:43.930
We won't let you give our world a Bad End!

00:11:43.930 --> 00:11:44.940
Girls!

00:11:44.940 --> 00:11:45.860
Right!

00:11:49.850 --> 00:11:51.140
Ready?

00:11:51.610 --> 00:11:54.480
Precure, Smile Charge!

00:11:54.480 --> 00:11:55.600
Go!

00:11:56.410 --> 00:11:57.860
Go, go!

00:11:58.240 --> 00:11:59.860
Let's go!

00:13:01.780 --> 00:13:04.740
The light of the future, shining bright!

00:13:06.360 --> 00:13:07.960
Cure Happy!

00:13:10.120 --> 00:13:11.910
Dazzling sun!

00:13:11.910 --> 00:13:13.910
Hot-blooded power!

00:13:14.900 --> 00:13:16.640
Cure Sunny!

00:13:18.690 --> 00:13:21.780
Rock, paper, scissors! Sparkling bright...

00:13:23.080 --> 00:13:24.840
Cure Peace!

00:13:26.600 --> 00:13:30.110
Laying down the gauntlet, with courage blazing!

00:13:31.070 --> 00:13:33.140
Cure March!

00:13:35.420 --> 00:13:38.940
A gentle heart as pure as the driven snow...

00:13:40.150 --> 00:13:41.940
Cure Beauty!

00:13:43.750 --> 00:13:46.420
Our five lights will blaze a path to the future!

00:13:52.250 --> 00:13:56.730
Shining bright, Smile Precure!

00:13:58.550 --> 00:14:02.340
This is bad-kuru! I've got to go tell them-kuru!

00:14:02.340 --> 00:14:03.600
Akanbe!

00:14:12.580 --> 00:14:15.330
Huh? This Akanbe's not as strong as the others...

00:14:15.640 --> 00:14:17.080
Don't let your guard down!

00:14:19.050 --> 00:14:20.250
It didn't work?

00:14:20.420 --> 00:14:23.490
Alright then! Focus, focus, focus... focus!

00:14:27.610 --> 00:14:28.830
Precure...

00:14:30.290 --> 00:14:32.490
Happy...

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:34.670
Shower!

00:14:43.380 --> 00:14:44.650
Alright!

00:14:46.700 --> 00:14:48.310
Akanbe!

00:14:49.160 --> 00:14:50.450
Why didn't it work?!

00:14:53.140 --> 00:14:59.790
<i>As opposed to our normal red noses, the Akanbe these generate will be totally immune to the Precures' moves.</i>

00:15:00.160 --> 00:15:01.760
Oh, I like this!

00:15:03.450 --> 00:15:05.820
Fine then, we'll take it down together!

00:15:06.400 --> 00:15:07.870
Don't be so hasty!

00:15:09.270 --> 00:15:10.860
Precure...

00:15:13.400 --> 00:15:16.040
Sunny Fire!

00:15:17.550 --> 00:15:18.780
Precure...

00:15:20.610 --> 00:15:22.410
Peace...

00:15:23.050 --> 00:15:24.780
Thunder!

00:15:25.350 --> 00:15:26.850
Precure...

00:15:28.180 --> 00:15:31.660
March Shoot!

00:15:38.220 --> 00:15:40.630
Akanbe!

00:15:41.660 --> 00:15:43.510
None of them worked?!

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:46.350
Do our attacks not affect it...?

00:15:46.350 --> 00:15:48.110
Precisely!

00:15:48.110 --> 00:15:52.140
Your moves are designed to purify Cure Décors, after all.

00:15:52.140 --> 00:15:55.720
But these blue noses aren't made from Cure Décors!

00:15:55.980 --> 00:15:59.020
So those moves of yours won't do a thing!

00:16:00.070 --> 00:16:03.420
Then what are we meant to do, Candy?!

00:16:03.420 --> 00:16:06.300
Hey, where is Candy, anyway?

00:16:06.300 --> 00:16:08.190
Happy, I'm afraid Candy's...

00:16:08.190 --> 00:16:11.260
Kuru!

00:16:11.720 --> 00:16:13.500
Get them, Akanbe!

00:16:13.500 --> 00:16:15.670
Akanbe!

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:26.300
Are you alright?

00:16:26.300 --> 00:16:27.970
I can't get out!

00:16:27.970 --> 00:16:29.590
The heck's with these capsules?!

00:16:29.590 --> 00:16:31.050
What can I do...?

00:16:31.440 --> 00:16:32.850
Get her too, Akanbe!

00:16:40.300 --> 00:16:41.690
I've gotta...

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:47.870
I've gotta...!

00:16:49.200 --> 00:16:51.870
I've gotta go help them-kuru!

00:16:56.930 --> 00:16:59.090
This will never end at this rate...

00:16:59.090 --> 00:17:01.040
If I can at least pin it down...

00:17:03.390 --> 00:17:04.670
Precure...

00:17:07.090 --> 00:17:10.790
Beauty Blizzard!

00:17:10.790 --> 00:17:12.990
Stupid girl! It's not going to work!

00:17:17.960 --> 00:17:20.260
Akanbe!

00:17:20.260 --> 00:17:21.230
Wha-?!

00:17:21.230 --> 00:17:22.530
Oh, I get it!

00:17:22.530 --> 00:17:24.200
She froze the Akanbe to the ground!

00:17:27.260 --> 00:17:28.580
Beauty!

00:17:30.510 --> 00:17:34.480
Looks like you're done for, you little Precure brat! Time to finish you!

00:17:35.910 --> 00:17:37.950
Stop-kuru!

00:17:38.190 --> 00:17:38.920
Huh?!

00:17:39.270 --> 00:17:43.940
Kuru!

00:17:44.860 --> 00:17:45.960
Candy!

00:17:46.180 --> 00:17:46.890
What?!

00:17:47.160 --> 00:17:53.270
I've got bad news-kuru! Your moves aren't gonna work on that blue-nosed Akanbe-kuru!

00:17:54.960 --> 00:17:57.340
I think they've figured that out already!

00:17:58.470 --> 00:18:02.080
Candy, how are we meant to beat that Akanbe?

00:18:02.080 --> 00:18:03.010
Kuru?

00:18:03.010 --> 00:18:05.260
We ain't got a chance unless we know how to beat it!

00:18:05.510 --> 00:18:06.010
Kuru...

00:18:06.270 --> 00:18:07.250
Candy!

00:18:07.580 --> 00:18:08.450
Candy...

00:18:08.710 --> 00:18:09.920
Candy!

00:18:12.640 --> 00:18:14.390
I don't know-kuru...

00:18:16.060 --> 00:18:17.790
I'm so sorry-kuru...

00:18:21.010 --> 00:18:23.430
You really are a useless little fairy!

00:18:23.760 --> 00:18:24.410
Kuru?

00:18:24.410 --> 00:18:26.180
Look at you! A stupid crybaby to boot!

00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:27.070
Kuru...

00:18:27.070 --> 00:18:28.530
You're just holding them back!

00:18:28.620 --> 00:18:29.470
Kuru...

00:18:30.240 --> 00:18:32.210
You useless wimp!

00:18:32.680 --> 00:18:34.890
Kuru...

00:18:35.750 --> 00:18:37.380
Silence!

00:18:38.540 --> 00:18:39.200
Kuru?

00:18:39.610 --> 00:18:44.330
Candy has been nothing but resolute in her desire to help us!

00:18:44.330 --> 00:18:47.190
I can think of nothing in this world that is more important...

00:18:47.190 --> 00:18:49.960
...than doing what one can for one's friends!

00:18:50.160 --> 00:18:52.750
Huh? Did something happen with you two?

00:18:52.750 --> 00:18:55.930
Candy's been suffering in silence...

00:18:56.330 --> 00:18:58.930
wondering how she can be of use to us all...

00:18:58.930 --> 00:19:00.430
wishing she could fight with us...

00:19:00.650 --> 00:19:01.600
Kuru...

00:19:01.900 --> 00:19:03.340
Candy...

00:19:03.340 --> 00:19:05.780
I didn't know you were suffering like that...

00:19:05.780 --> 00:19:07.640
I'm sorry, Candy...

00:19:09.300 --> 00:19:13.350
What's to be gained by standing up for that little whelp?

00:19:13.660 --> 00:19:15.700
It's not about what we can gain from her...

00:19:15.700 --> 00:19:20.550
Just having her by my side makes me ultra happy!

00:19:21.050 --> 00:19:22.260
Happy...

00:19:22.490 --> 00:19:26.730
When Candy's all bright and happy, it puts a smile on my face!

00:19:27.220 --> 00:19:28.190
Sunny...

00:19:28.510 --> 00:19:32.100
I won't let you make fun of how hard she tries!

00:19:32.310 --> 00:19:33.570
Peace...

00:19:33.830 --> 00:19:37.520
It's thanks to Candy that we were all brought here together!

00:19:37.520 --> 00:19:39.540
Without her, we'd never have gotten this far!

00:19:39.730 --> 00:19:41.010
March...

00:19:41.180 --> 00:19:43.980
We will not just let you hurt her...

00:19:44.700 --> 00:19:45.950
...and get away with it!

00:19:53.520 --> 00:19:56.620
I... I...

00:19:57.510 --> 00:20:02.780
I want to help the Precure too-kuru!

00:20:09.070 --> 00:20:10.170
What are these...?

00:20:10.170 --> 00:20:12.140
They're new Cure Décors!

00:20:12.140 --> 00:20:16.340
Perhaps Candy's strength of feeling has given birth to a newfound power...

00:20:16.940 --> 00:20:20.680
I don't know what's going on, so just pulverize them, Akanbe!

00:20:20.680 --> 00:20:22.680
Akanbe!

00:20:32.960 --> 00:20:34.370
Precure...

00:20:37.320 --> 00:20:39.720
Rainbow...

00:20:39.720 --> 00:20:41.390
Healing!

00:20:44.190 --> 00:20:47.170
Akanbe...

00:20:54.080 --> 00:20:57.390
Damn it, Joker! This isn't what you promised!

00:21:02.390 --> 00:21:03.580
Candy!

00:21:03.580 --> 00:21:04.860
Girls!

00:21:05.080 --> 00:21:06.510
Thank goodness you're safe, Candy!

00:21:06.510 --> 00:21:07.690
What was that power?!

00:21:07.690 --> 00:21:09.150
I don't know-kuru!

00:21:09.150 --> 00:21:09.870
What?!

00:21:09.870 --> 00:21:11.830
Even you don't know, Candy?

00:21:12.320 --> 00:21:16.800
That white purifying light and that fairy...

00:21:17.170 --> 00:21:20.970
They might be a clue that leads to the Miracle Jewel...

00:21:22.970 --> 00:21:25.600
We didn't get a new Cure Décor, either...

00:21:25.600 --> 00:21:27.750
I suppose because it had that blue nose.

00:21:27.750 --> 00:21:30.910
But hey, we got a power-up out of the deal!

00:21:30.910 --> 00:21:33.220
Our great teamwork let us win!

00:21:33.880 --> 00:21:36.190
Yeah, it really did...

00:21:37.700 --> 00:21:39.470
After all...

00:21:40.380 --> 00:21:42.850
there's six of us Precure!

00:21:42.850 --> 00:21:43.470
Kuru?

00:21:43.470 --> 00:21:44.820
Right, Candy?

00:21:44.820 --> 00:21:46.560
Kuru!

00:21:56.270 --> 00:21:59.460
Candy, you can come on that field trip with us!

00:21:59.570 --> 00:22:01.220
Kuru!

00:23:39.350 --> 00:23:42.390
Our school trip finally lands us in Kyoto!

00:23:42.390 --> 00:23:44.490
Where're we goin', what're we doin', what're we eatin'?

00:23:44.490 --> 00:23:46.390
I wanna get a photo with one of the dancers!

00:23:46.390 --> 00:23:48.270
I'd like to see the Temple of the Golden Pavilion...

00:23:48.270 --> 00:23:50.230
I wanna try some green tea ice cream!

00:23:50.230 --> 00:23:52.210
Miyuki, why not get your fortune told-kuru?

00:23:52.210 --> 00:23:53.190
Okay then, let's see!

00:23:53.190 --> 00:23:54.870
Huh?! "You'll have bad luck"?!

00:23:56.460 --> 00:23:58.400
Smile Precure:

00:24:01.880 --> 00:24:04.140
Find your ultra happy smile!
